        <obo:IAO_0000115>An &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-α-amino acid which is &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-glutamic acid or any of the essential amino acids biosynthesised from it (glutamine, proline and arginine). A closed class.</obo:IAO_0000115>
