            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An aliphatic monocarboxylic acid with a chain length of less than C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;. If any non-hydrocarbon substituent is present, the compound is not normally regarded as a short-chain fatty acid.</obo:IAO_0000115>
