        <kbr:kodeATC>J01CA04</kbr:kodeATC>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>J01CA</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>BebasMakan</kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>
        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>4 CONTRAINDICATIONS Amoxicillin tablets are contraindicated in patients who have experienced a serious hypersensitivity reaction (e.g., anaphylaxis or Stevens-Johnson syndrome) to amoxicillin tablets or to other β-lactam antibacterial drugs (e.g., penicillins and cephalosporins). History of a serious hypersensitivity reaction (e.g., anaphylaxis or Stevens-Johnson syndrome) to amoxicillin tablets or to other beta-lact</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:maksDosisHarian>3000 mg/hari</kbr:maksDosisHarian>
        <kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>Sesuai resep dokter (harus habis)</kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:pantanganMakanan>Tidak ada pantangan makanan spesifik</kbr:pantanganMakanan>
        <kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>Penisilin; Ampicillin; Co-amoxiclav; hati-hati silang dengan Sefalosporin (Cefadroxil/Cefixime)</kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>
        <kbr:peringatanKhusus>ANTIBIOTIK RESEP. Periksa riwayat alergi penisilin.</kbr:peringatanKhusus>
        <kbr:urlSumberAlergi>https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=00fbd46e-05fd-4f8a-9f59-a7a4d01c8e54</kbr:urlSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>ResepDokter</kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:waktuMinumTeks>Bebas (sebelum atau sesudah makan)</kbr:waktuMinumTeks>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


