        <kbr:dosisMgPerKg>Dosis tetap dewasa (resep dokter)</kbr:dosisMgPerKg>
        <kbr:frekuensiMinum>1 kali sehari</kbr:frekuensiMinum>
        <kbr:gejalaAlergi>Ruam, urtikaria, angioedema, reaksi hipersensitivitas sistemik</kbr:gejalaAlergi>
        <kbr:golonganAlergen>Statin (Inhibitor HMG-CoA Reduktase)</kbr:golonganAlergen>
        <kbr:kodeATC>C10AA05</kbr:kodeATC>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>C10AA</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>BebasMakan</kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>
        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>4 CONTRAINDICATIONS Acute liver failure or decompensated cirrhosis [see Warnings and Precautions (5.3) ] Hypersensitivity to atorvastatin or any excipients in atorvastatin calcium. Hypersensitivity reactions, including anaphylaxis, angioneurotic edema, erythema multiforme, Stevens-Johnson syndrome, and toxic epidermal necrolysis, have been reported [see Adverse Reactions (6.2) ].</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:maksDosisHarian>80 mg/hari</kbr:maksDosisHarian>
        <kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>Obat rutin (sesuai resep dokter)</kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:pantanganMakanan>Jus grapefruit dalam jumlah besar; alkohol berat</kbr:pantanganMakanan>
        <kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>Simvastatin; Rosuvastatin; Fluvastatin (kelas statin)</kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>
        <kbr:peringatanKhusus>OBAT RESEP RUTIN. Hindari jus grapefruit dalam jumlah besar.</kbr:peringatanKhusus>
