        <kbr:chebiID>CHEBI:5855</kbr:chebiID>
        <kbr:dosisAnak>Usia &gt;=6 bln: 5-10 mg/kg tiap 6-8 jam</kbr:dosisAnak>
        <kbr:dosisDewasa>200-400 mg tiap 4-6 jam</kbr:dosisDewasa>
        <kbr:dosisMgPerKg>5-10 mg/kg/dosis tiap 6-8 jam</kbr:dosisMgPerKg>
        <kbr:frekuensiMinum>3 kali sehari</kbr:frekuensiMinum>
        <kbr:gejalaAlergi>Urtikaria, angioedema (bengkak bibir/kelopak mata), bronkospasme / sesak napas, anafilaksis</kbr:gejalaAlergi>
        <kbr:golonganAlergen>NSAID (Turunan Asam Propionat)</kbr:golonganAlergen>
        <kbr:kodeATC>M01AE01</kbr:kodeATC>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>M01AE</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>SesudahMakan</kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>
        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>CONTRAINDICATIONS Ibuprofen tablets are contraindicated in patients with known hypersensitivity to Ibuprofen. Ibuprofen tablets should not be given to patients who have experienced asthma, urticaria, or allergic-type reactions after taking aspirin or other NSAIDs.</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:maksDosisHarian>1200 mg/hari (swamedikasi)</kbr:maksDosisHarian>
        <kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>3 hari (demam) / 5 hari (nyeri)</kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:pantanganMakanan>Alkohol; perut kosong; suplemen pengencer darah</kbr:pantanganMakanan>
        <kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>Aspirin; Naproxen; Diclofenac; Asam Mefenamat; Celecoxib / NSAID lain (risiko asma-terinduksi-aspirin)</kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>
        <kbr:peringatanKhusus>Jangan diminum saat perut kosong; hentikan bila nyeri ulu hati atau BAB hitam.</kbr:peringatanKhusus>
        <kbr:urlSumberAlergi>https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=00872852-680a-41b3-901b-b991b12a176d</kbr:urlSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>2</kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:waktuMinumTeks>Bersama atau segera sesudah makan</kbr:waktuMinumTeks>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


