        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>Itraconazole capsules are contraindicated for patients who have shown hypersensitivity to itraconazole. There is limited information regarding cross-hypersensitivity between itraconazole and other azole antifungal agents.</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
