        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>Hypersensitivity to metformin. Severe renal impairment (eGFR below 30 mL/min/1.73 m 2 ) ( 4 , 5.1 ) Hypersensitivity to metformin ( 4 ) Acute or chronic metabolic acidosis, including diabetic ketoacidosis, with or without coma.</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
