        <kbr:bbMinSwamedikasi>20</kbr:bbMinSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:chebiID>CHEBI:8093</kbr:chebiID>
        <kbr:dosisAnak>6-12 th: 5 mg tiap 4 jam</kbr:dosisAnak>
        <kbr:dosisDewasa>10 mg tiap 4 jam</kbr:dosisDewasa>
        <kbr:dosisMgPerKg>Berbasis umur (non-mg/kg)</kbr:dosisMgPerKg>
        <kbr:frekuensiMinum>3-4 kali sehari (pagi &amp; siang)</kbr:frekuensiMinum>
        <kbr:gejalaAlergi>Ruam, urtikaria, dermatitis kontak (sediaan topikal)</kbr:gejalaAlergi>
        <kbr:golonganAlergen>Dekongestan Agonis Alfa-1</kbr:golonganAlergen>
        <kbr:kodeATC>R01BA03</kbr:kodeATC>
        <kbr:kodeATC4>R01BA</kbr:kodeATC4>
        <kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>BebasMakan_HindariMalam</kbr:kodeHubunganMakan>
        <kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>Do not use if you are now taking a prescription monoamine oxidase inhibitor (MAOI) (certain drugs for depression, psychiatric or emotional conditions, or Parkinson’s disease), or for 2 weeks after stopping the MAOI drug. If you do not know if your prescription drug contains an MAOI, ask a doctor or pharmacist before taking this product.</kbr:kutipanSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:maksDosisHarian>60 mg/hari</kbr:maksDosisHarian>
        <kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>3-5 hari</kbr:maksHariSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:pantanganMakanan>Kafein/kopi berlebih</kbr:pantanganMakanan>
        <kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>Pseudoefedrin / amina simpatomimetik lain; sulfit pada beberapa sediaan</kbr:pemicuAlergiSilang>
        <kbr:peringatanKhusus>Efek vasokonstriktor sistemik dapat menaikkan tekanan darah.</kbr:peringatanKhusus>
        <kbr:urlSumberAlergi>https://dailymed.nlm.nih.gov/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=0153294d-7f52-4d92-8db8-daeca3e29a3b</kbr:urlSumberAlergi>
        <kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>6</kbr:usiaMinSwamedikasi>
        <kbr:waktuMinumTeks>Pagi/siang hari; bebas makan</kbr:waktuMinumTeks>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


