    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_67547">
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the class of xanthones that is 9&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;-xanthene substituted by hydroxy group at positions 1, 3 and 6, a methoxy group at position 7, an oxo group at position 9 and prenyl groups at positions 2 and 8. Isolated from the stems of &lt;em&gt;Cratoxylum cochinchinense&lt;/em&gt;, it exhibits antioxidant, antimicrobial and antitumour activities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
